flowchart LR
  U([Operador / Dono / Membro / sk]) -->|HTTP| GW[Gateway]
  GW --> R[Receiver]
  R -->|leitura: views v1| DB[(SSOT: schema ipm)]
  R -->|consulta escopo| ORGR[ipm.organization Receiver]
  R -->|membro e usuários no grupo| USRR[ipm.user Receiver]
  R -->|requested| REQ[(REQUESTED)]
  REQ --> M[Manager]
  M -->|Group, Operation, outbox| DB
  DB -->|outbox pendente| P[Publisher]
  P -->|desired| DES[(DESIRED)]
  DES --> REC[Reconciler]
  DES --> OBS[Observer]
  OBSV[(OBSERVED)] --> REC
  OBS -->|observed| OBSV
  REC -->|action| ACT[(ACTION, 4 partições)]
  ACT --> EX[Executor]
  EX -->|completed ou failed| RES[(RESULT)]
  RES --> REC
  RES --> OBS
  OBSV -->|fase e Operation| M
  RES -->|resultado por actionId| M
  EX -->|escrita transacional| ST[(platform: schema ipm)]
  OBS -->|somente SELECT| ST
  DES -->|expansão de groups em roles| USR[ipm.user Manager / Reconciler]
